%% Activity — semester rollover
flowchart TD
  A([Super admin]) --> B[Create semester e.g. Fall 2026<br/>set start and end dates]
  B --> C[Make semester current — confirm]
  C --> D[All CR and DCR roles end]
  C --> E[All students marked unconfirmed]
  C --> F[Old section groups closed, read-only]
  C --> G[Old routines archived]
  D --> H[Each dept admin: for every section<br/>re-appoint last CR/DCR or pick new]
  H --> I[Section opens for join requests;<br/>new section group created]
  H --> J[Dept admin imports and publishes new routine]
  E --> K[Student logs in → semester update screen<br/>pre-filled with suggested next term]
  K --> L[/Student confirms or edits level, term,<br/>section, group — repeaters keep term/]
  L --> M{Section open?}
  M -- No --> N[Wait until CR named] --> M
  M -- Yes --> O[Join request → CR/DCR]
  O --> P{Accepted?}
  P -- No --> L
  P -- Yes --> Q[Profile stamped 'Fall 2026 confirmed';<br/>joins new group]
  E --> R{Unconfirmed after 14 days?}
  R -- Yes --> S[Listed for admin follow-up<br/>no lockout change]
  Q --> T([Normal use resumes])
